    "id": "2046855630300868621",
    "text": "There is a brilliant separation of concerns here:\nMonad Foundation: Handles the community, ecosystem, and governance.\n🔬Category Labs: Handles the raw, low-level execution (custom databases, parallel execution engines, JIT compilers).",
    "author": "cryptobroforeve",
