    "id": "2046855627377373404",
    "text": "The vision shared by Category Labs and the Monad Foundation is massive: closing the biggest gap in DeFi by delivering extreme scalability without sacrificing EVM compatibility or decentralization.\n​How? By treating the entire stack as an optimization problem.",
